        "title": "Brand New Tool Kits — 2026",
        "content": "<p>These are completely new moulds — not re-issues, not re-boxes. Brand new tooling from Airfix for 2026. If you only buy a few kits this year, these are the ones.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": ""
